From af84bad2a2951c08dfabb28a3d20b821f89f7401 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ultimatejeeves <ultimatejeeves@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 13:56:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 34/43] DMA: channel 1 stays busy until the VPU1 thread took
 its data; GS: register runs, cached triangle vertices, fewer GL calls per
 draw; VIF1 status polls during a pending interrupt are idle; debug traces

